    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/236d5c7e4f758dffbf08bbdd07268e44.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/236d5c7e4f758dffbf08bbdd07268e44.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>Bob, weave, evade, and shoot through a space sector filled to the brim with enemies. The game is built with rushes and high-speed chases in mind, so make full use of your mobility and firepower.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/42de7ae8db6bc84c985acad9ccdd2f59.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/42de7ae8db6bc84c985acad9ccdd2f59.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>Encounter hazardous scenarios as you warp around various space sectors. As a newly-listed Confiner, you are to keep the vast space safe and keep rising threats to a manageable level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/66469df9e2a4cba466a72a531bf8322c.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/66469df9e2a4cba466a72a531bf8322c.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2> Choose from a variety of ships to pilot, each with its own stats, starting weapons and passive abilities. Upgrade its equipment, and create builds that suit your play style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/b893f6d1131fe6bebf3fa098d8251752.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/b893f6d1131fe6bebf3fa098d8251752.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>The enemy forces build up as time passes, increasing the <strong>Incursion Rate</strong>. As this value rises, new events and dangerous threats enter the fray. Keep this value down by destroying key enemy units to prevent yourself from getting overwhelmed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/1eabced3b1d7d456b9088497bd7e5973.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/1eabced3b1d7d456b9088497bd7e5973.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>Aside from the ship you control, you can summon your <strong>Support Craft</strong> into the field for extra firepower. Not only that, approach it to open up the Support Shop, where you upgrade your ship and use other support actions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/22d42b589fbe10d2cd12d5734beb34fb.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/22d42b589fbe10d2cd12d5734beb34fb.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>You get rewards after a game session, which you can spend unlocking new ships, or customizing your ships even further and making them stronger!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><br><i>&quot;Here at PhaigeX Megacorp, we pioneer the latest trends in AI and Warp technologies.<br>Join our elite team of Confiners to keep our space pathways safe from the rogue AI menace.<br>It is our mission to pave the way towards humanity's shining future, whatever it takes.<br>So take the leap, and accomplish great achievements together with us!&quot;</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/236d5c7e4f758dffbf08bbdd07268e44.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/236d5c7e4f758dffbf08bbdd07268e44.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>Bob, weave, evade, and shoot through a space sector filled to the brim with enemies. The game is built with rushes and high-speed chases in mind, so make full use of your mobility and firepower.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/42de7ae8db6bc84c985acad9ccdd2f59.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/42de7ae8db6bc84c985acad9ccdd2f59.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>Encounter hazardous scenarios as you warp around various space sectors. As a newly-listed Confiner, you are to keep the vast space safe and keep rising threats to a manageable level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/66469df9e2a4cba466a72a531bf8322c.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/66469df9e2a4cba466a72a531bf8322c.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2> Choose from a variety of ships to pilot, each with its own stats, starting weapons and passive abilities. Upgrade its equipment, and create builds that suit your play style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/b893f6d1131fe6bebf3fa098d8251752.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/b893f6d1131fe6bebf3fa098d8251752.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>The enemy forces build up as time passes, increasing the <strong>Incursion Rate</strong>. As this value rises, new events and dangerous threats enter the fray. Keep this value down by destroying key enemy units to prevent yourself from getting overwhelmed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/1eabced3b1d7d456b9088497bd7e5973.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/1eabced3b1d7d456b9088497bd7e5973.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>Aside from the ship you control, you can summon your <strong>Support Craft</strong> into the field for extra firepower. Not only that, approach it to open up the Support Shop, where you upgrade your ship and use other support actions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/22d42b589fbe10d2cd12d5734beb34fb.poster.avif?t=1738467787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159500/extras/22d42b589fbe10d2cd12d5734beb34fb.webm?t=1738467787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2>You get rewards after a game session, which you can spend unlocking new ships, or customizing your ships even further and making them stronger!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><br><i>&quot;Here at PhaigeX Megacorp, we pioneer the latest trends in AI and Warp technologies.<br>Join our elite team of Confiners to keep our space pathways safe from the rogue AI menace.<br>It is our mission to pave the way towards humanity's shining future, whatever it takes.<br>So take the leap, and accomplish great achievements together with us!&quot;</i>",
    "short_description": "PhaigeX is a fast-paced &quot;Bullet Heaven&quot; space shooter, tasking the player to explore space sectors and contain a rising incursion of rogue AI-controlled units. Pilot a variety of ships, call in the support craft, and use a myriad of upgrades to lay down heavy firepower towards the enemy forces.",
